<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We are particularly thrilled to be joined by some very special guests today, including VIPs, esteemed teachers, and officials from the Ministry of Education. Your presence elevates this event, and we are deeply grateful for your support in fostering the next generation of tech innovators.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
