122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As you embark on this final challenge, remember that you are part of something much larger than a competition. You are contributing to a legacy of innovation that spans across borders, one that will continue to grow and evolve with each new idea and every breakthrough. We are incredibly proud of all you have accomplished and look forward to seeing the extraordinary impact you will make in the world.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
