126 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The International Innovative Tech Summit \(IITS\) was established as a global platform to unite young innovators, educators, and industry leaders in exploring and advancing cutting-edge technologies. Organized by Eduwel Sdn. Bhd. and Beijing Gehua Culture Center Co. Ltd., IITS is the culmination of international tech competitions like the Youth Tech Asia Challenge \(YTAC\) and the International Creativity and Innovative Award \(ICIA\).)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (IITS offers participants a comprehensive experience through competitions, forums, workshops, and exhibitions. It aims to inspire creative thinking, skill development, and collaboration to address global challenges. By connecting diverse minds, IITS fosters a community of innovators ready to lead in the ever-evolving tech landscape.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Objective: )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (International Innovative Tech Summit \(IITS\) is to provide a global platform for students, educators, and industry experts to collaborate, innovate, and showcase their technological and creative talents. Through a series of competitions, exhibitions, and forums, IITS aims to foster a deeper understanding of emerging technologies, encourage the development of practical skills, and promote the exchange of ideas across borders. The summit also seeks to inspire participants to address global challenges through innovation, while providing opportunities for investment and future growth in the technology sector.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
