133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Participants are encouraged to think beyond theoretical concepts and focus on developing prototypes that have practical applications in the real world. Whether it's a breakthrough in artificial intelligence, a novel approach to renewable energy, or an innovative use of blockchain technology, the aim is to create something that can be truly transformative.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The emphasis on real commercial or market value means that your innovations should have the potential to meet actual needs, solve existing problems, or open new opportunities in the market. This not only challenges you to be inventive but also to think strategically about how your creations can be scaled, marketed, and implemented in the real world.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
